<title>JAPAN: Melco to buy back up to 135,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Melco to buy back up to 135,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Melco Inc said on Monday it had decided to repurchase up to 135,000 of its common shares at a cost not to exceed 700 million yen.</p>
<p>Melco, which specialises in the manufacture of PC peripherals, said in a statement that the share repurchase plan needed to be approved at its shareholders' meeting scheduled for June 26.</p>
</text>
